{"unit_id":"lhh010__dsh-minigames#feature-1","repo":"lhh010/dsh-minigames","commit":"10e644738b038022ff6451145476aa3b9cdebb6c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-minigames 的功能「浮动游戏面板」：在 DSH Web 页面挂载游戏选择器和游戏区域，可拖动窗口、调整宽度并吸附边缘；点击折叠态的手柄可重新打开。选择游戏后启动对应实例。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/panel/Panel.tsx:319-426"]}
{"unit_id":"lhh010__dsh-minigames#feature-2","repo":"lhh010/dsh-minigames","commit":"10e644738b038022ff6451145476aa3b9cdebb6c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-minigames 的功能「游戏生命周期控制」：选择游戏时创建并启动实例；切换游戏或卸载时销毁实例。用户可暂停，面板收起或浏览器标签页隐藏时自动暂停，恢复可见时继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/panel/Panel.tsx:450-496"]}
{"unit_id":"lhh010__dsh-minigames#feature-3","repo":"lhh010/dsh-minigames","commit":"10e644738b038022ff6451145476aa3b9cdebb6c","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-minigames 的功能「本地记录」：面板把开合状态、所选游戏、位置、停靠状态、宽度和每款游戏的最高分保存到浏览器 localStorage，刷新后可恢复窗口状态和成绩。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/panel/Panel.tsx:24-30","src/client/panel/Panel.tsx:80-117","src/client/panel/Panel.tsx:154-171"]}
